002	EXO	022	030	Kala bilen qoyliringning tunji balilirinimu hem shundaq atighin; tunji bala yette kün’giche anisi bilen bille tursun; emma sekkizinchi küni uni Manga atap sun’ghin.
002	EXO	022	031	Siler Manga atalghan muqeddes kishiler bolisiler; shunga dalada yirtquch haywan teripidin boghulghan haywanning göshini yémenglar, belki uni itlargha tashlap béringlar.
