009	1SA	020	012	Yonatan Dawutqa mundaq dédi: — Israilning Xudasi Perwerdigar manga [guwahki], men ete yaki ögünlükke mushu waqitta atamning niyitini bilip, sanga iltipatliq bolsa, men adem mangdurup sanga melum qilmamdim?
009	1SA	020	013	Eger atam sanga yamanliq qilmaqchi bolsa, men séni tinch-aman yolgha sélish üchün sanga adem ewetip xewer bermisem, Perwerdigar manga séning béshinggha chüshkendinmu artuq chüshürsun; emdi Perwerdigar atam bilen bille bolghandek séning bilen bille bolsun.
009	1SA	020	014	Hayatla bolsam méni ölmisun dep Perwerdigarning méhribanliqini manga körsetkeysen.
