010	2SA	017	001	Ahitofel Abshalomgha: Manga on ikki ming ademni talliwélishqa ruxset berseng, men bügün kéche qozghilip, Dawutni qoghlay;
010	2SA	017	002	Men uning üstige chüshkinimde u hérip, qolliri ajiz bolidu; men uni alaqzade qiliwétimen, shundaqla uning bilen bolghan barliq xelq qachidu. Men peqet padishahnila urup öltürimen,
010	2SA	017	003	andin hemme xelqni sanga béqindurup qayturimen. Sen izdigen adem yoqalsa, hemme xelq séning qéshinggha qaytidu; shuning bilen hemme xelq aman-ésen qalidu, dédi.
