010	2SA	018	033	Padishah tolimu azablinip, derwazining töpisidiki balixanigha yighlighan péti chiqti; u mangghach: I oghlum Abshalom! I oghlum, oghlum Abshalom! Kashki, men séning ornungda ölsem bolmasmidi! I Abshalom, méning oghlum, méning oghlum! dédi.
