013	1CH	006	043	Shimey Jahatning oghli, Jahat Gershomning oghli, Gershom Lawiyning oghli idi.
013	1CH	006	044	[Héman bilen Asafning] sol teripide xizmette turghan qérindashliri Merarining ewladliridin Étanlar idi. Étan bolsa Kishining oghli idi, Kishi Abdining oghli, Abdi Malluqning oghli,
