014	2CH	024	006	Buni uqqan padishah bash kahin Yehoyadani chaqirtip uninggha: — Özliri némishqa Lawiylargha Perwerdigarning quli Musa Israil jamaitige Xudaning guwahliqi saqlaqliq chédir üchün belgiligen bajni Yehuda we Yérusalémdin élip kélishke buyrumidila? — dédi
014	2CH	024	007	(chünki eslide rezil xotun Ataliya we uning oghulliri Xudaning öyige bösüp kirip, Perwerdigarning öyidiki barliq muqeddes buyumlarni élip Baal butlirigha atap teqdim qiliwetkenidi).
