016	NEH	013	006	Bu waqitlarda men Yérusalémda emes idim; chünki Babil padishahi Artaxshashtaning ottuz ikkinchi yili men padishahning yénigha qaytip ketkenidim; bir mezgildin kéyin men yene padishahtin ruxset élip
