019	PSA	063	001	Dawut yazghan küy (u Yehudadiki chöl-bayawanda bolghan chaghda yézilghan): — I Xuda, Sen méning ilahimdursen, Teshnaliq bilen Séni izdidim! Men qurghaq, changqaq, susiz zéminda turup, Jénim Sanga intizar, etlirim telmürüp intilarki —
019	PSA	063	002	Muqeddes jayingda Sanga köz tikip qarighinimdek, Men yene zor qudriting we ulughluqungni körsem!
