019	PSA	064	001	Neghmichilerning béshigha tapshurulup oqulsun dep, Dawut yazghan küy: — I Xuda, ahlirimni kötürgende, méni anglighaysen! Hayatimni düshmenning wehshilikidin qughdighaysen!
