041	MAR	015	041	Ular eslide Eysa Galiliye ölkiside turghan waqitta uninggha egiship, uning xizmitide bolghanlar idi; bulardin bashqa uning bilen Yérusalémgha birge kelgen yene nurghun ayallarmu [uning ehwaligha] qarap turatti.
041	MAR	015	042	Kechqurun kirip qalghanda («teyyarlash küni», yeni shabat künining aldinqi küni bolghachqa),
